Do not create standalone Field Analysis or Trends & Comparisons pages, tabs, routes, APIs, components or dashboards. Deep Analysis must still show results for each field included in a farm-wide run, inside that report. Reports & Analysis History must still allow users to open and compare saved reports. These are capabilities within the three retained areas, not additional sections.

Open Advanced on Deep Analysis by default. Keep all three areas connected to the same canonical farm, field, observation, calculation, report, finding and action records. Use the APIs and fallback strategy in this document, but verify official product documentation and terms before implementation. Use exact scientific meanings and preserve uncertainty. A missing API must lead to an accurate alternative or an explicit unavailable result—not fabricated data.

